{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the biotech lab dungeons of Mighty Meow, an action RPG about saving animals and building a warm little settlement. Dash and fight through rooms full of robots, rescue cute animals, then head back to a cozy base where your new friends craft weapons and shields for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wiggle and dash through danger as you crash into swarms of robots. Turn each dash into a punchy close range attacks or mix in special skills to defeat as many enemies as possible.\u00a0 The right skill at the right moment could turn the tide of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/956f86a1eff732c628a54545ace07c52.avif?t=1763717451\" width=960 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue adorable animals trapped in underground labs. Each victory brings a new furry ally to your settlement, helping you grow stronger and expand your base to take on even greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/a0425a8c1f262c1ac65a75a4063a648d.avif?t=1763717451\" width=960 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rescued animal has a unique ability that shapes your strategy. Stone gathering hedgehogs, item transporting sugar gliders, and many more friends help you collect resources and craft powerful gear while you are off fighting in the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every few levels a new helper animal joins your team with new recipes that push your gear to the next tier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/1818f944bb3e0471c2fd91f2790ff1f1.avif?t=1763717451\" width=960 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friendship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greet animals and give them presents to grow your friendship. As your bond deepens they will send sweet messages or even burst into cheerful dance moves.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have plenty of cute looks to choose from, but you will need to earn the trust of your furry little friends before new skins unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/974d3faf9c5cb78872e0d594cd18b23c.avif?t=1763717451\" width=960 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo and Wishlist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo is out now \ud83d\ude1d Wishlist to be notified when the full game is released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.poster.avif?t=1763717451\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.webm?t=1763717451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.mp4?t=1763717451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3262100?t=1763717451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3262100?t=1763717451","capsule_image":"https:/